\par 2. Kh\u7845\'3fu hao h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n trong "Kho\u7843\'3fn m\u7909\'3f}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10837408\charrsid2185575 c kinh ph\'ed ph\'e2n x\'fd}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10837408\charrsid2185575 \u7903\'3fng" c\u7911\'3fa gi\'e1 th\'e0nh.
\par 3. Kh\u7845\'3fu hao h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n trong "Kho\u7843\'3fn m\u7909\'3fc qu\u7843\'3fn l\'fd ph\'ed x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp " c\u7911\'3fa gi\'e1 th\'e0nh.
\par Ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch kh\u7845\'3fu hao t\u7841\'3fm th\u7901\'3fi n\'e0y bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f m\u7913\'3fc ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch kh\u7845\'3f}{\f172\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10837408\charrsid2185575 u hao c\'f5 b}{
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10837408\charrsid2185575 \u7843\'3fn v\'e0 kh\u7845\'3fu hao s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn.}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid923591\charrsid2185575 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx1350\tx2070\tx2790\tx3510\tx4230\tx4950\tx5670\tx6390\tx7110\tx7830\tx8550\tx9270\tx9990\tx10710\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6294855 {\b\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid10837408\charrsid2185575 II. L\u7852\'3fP K
